Z||000000||Haze_Performance||10-11-2001||12:52 AM||||Well I can't find a complete set of new locks. (Door & Trunk) If I bought a set for the door & one for the trunk, can a locksmith cut the locks so they use the same key? (Like they do for house locks)<P>TIA <BR>-Haze  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">              .              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">        <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
