Z||000002||My7Fieros||10-11-2001||01:43 AM||||Yeah locksmiths can....same principle as house locks..they use a guage for the key and then put in new pins and springs in the cylinoid (I used to work at a hardware store and did it zillions of times).<BR>BTW Haze I got your video and will copy it and send yours back..thanx!<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><P><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 10-11-2001).]||||reg||1
